Model weights
-------------
- weights/planner.pt — Apache-2.0. Trained from scratch on procedurally
  generated data. No pretrained weights, no external audio.
- The optional detail model is NOT distributed with this repository. It was
  trained on ESC-50 and is released separately under CC BY-NC-4.0 for research
  use only. See weights/README.md.

Datasets
--------
- ESC-50 (Piczak, 2015), CC BY-NC 3.0 (the ESC-10 subset is CC BY),
  https://github.com/karolpiczak/ESC-50
  Used only to train the optional detail model. Not redistributed here.
- The planner training data (caption/Spec pairs from scripts/gen_scores.py and
  plain-text/Spec pairs from scripts/gen_freetext.py) is procedurally
  generated and contains no third-party content.

Project page and demo film (site/)
----------------------------------
- Pyodide (MPL-2.0), https://pyodide.org. Loaded at runtime from the
  jsDelivr CDN by site/worker.js; not redistributed here.
- Fonts: Fraunces, DM Sans and DM Mono, SIL Open Font License 1.1, loaded
  from Google Fonts; also rendered into the demo film.
- site/assets/orb-demo.mp4 contains third-party media that is NOT covered by
  Apache-2.0:
  - "Lightning bolt striking over a city at night" by Theo Tab,
    https://unsplash.com/photos/2wh869865gs, Unsplash License
    (https://unsplash.com/license).
  - "Gray and black laptop computer on surface" by Ales Nesetril,
    https://unsplash.com/photos/Im7lZjxeLhg, Unsplash License.
